Z||000009||MinnGreenGT||11-30-2001||10:42 AM||||Interesting website... they have all their photos "copyright..."  but many of them are cars from here (I specifically noticed NOS3800's purple ride!).  I don't think they had anything at all to do with that car.<P>BUT, they do have some really cool accessories... interior options, some cool exterior stuff.  Pics of a silver GT convertible with the 'vette-style lights molded in.  Nice.  I also kind of like the "real spoiler" they have on a yellow fastback.  It's reminiscent of the black spoiler common to the Ferrari 308/328 body style (It runs a little more than $300USD).  I'd be interested to see if they're willing to export to the US.  Anyone local to them want to ask around for us?<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
